& [CanonicalRecord: IR3ImplementationActivation] is the processed planning authority for IR3 bounded operator harness implementation activation slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 4e5c6c0b-c7cc-4480-9d4b-17f294f5b167
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 3245cdc2-4a4c-484c-a513-e95ea977e33f
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is f5618b4a-78b8-4aef-8b18-c58f9083ee5a
  + [authority_scope] is IR3 implementation activation slice order, gates, expected outputs, model routing, file inventory, fixture inventory, generated-output proof, implementation boundaries, and forbidden downstream scope
  + [implementation_scope] is bounded operator harness implementation activation planning and gated implementation slices
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR3_Operator_Harness_Activation_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/IR3_Completion_Review.v1.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/IR3_Implementation_Activation_Slices.v1.sop as the current IR3 implementation activation surface
  = must: execute IR3-IA01 first
  = must: run completion review after each IR3 implementation activation slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: preserve generated traces, fixture outputs, reports, manifests, and caches as non-authoritative projections
  - never: treat IR3 implementation activation as permission for LangGraph runtime implementation, surface implementation, adapter implementation, operations simulator implementation, operations control, or live machine control

& [CanonicalIR3ImplementationActivationSliceSet] is the final IR3 implementation activation slice sequence
  + [slice] is IR3-IA01 bounded implementation activation boundary and file inventory confirmation
  + [slice] is IR3-IA02 fixture source and expected-ledger seed material
  + [slice] is IR3-IA03 contracts and trace model implementation
  + [slice] is IR3-IA04 contract-driven operator runner implementation
  + [slice] is IR3-IA05 fixture runner implementation
  + [slice] is IR3-IA06 contract test integration and generated-output proof
  + [slice] is IR3-IA07 implementation completion review and operator harness proof pack

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes IR3 implementation activation

& [CanonicalIR3ImplementationActivationGate] is the activation rule for IR3 implementation
  + [current_ready_slice] is IR3-IA01
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-IA02 until IR3-IA01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-IA03 until IR3-IA02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-IA04 until IR3-IA03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-IA05 until IR3-IA04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-IA06 until IR3-IA05 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR3-IA07 until IR3-IA06 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is IR3 implementation proof pack accepted after IR3-IA07

& [CanonicalIR3ImplementationActivationModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [IR3-IA01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR3-IA02] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR3-IA01 acceptance
  + [IR3-IA03] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR3-IA02 acceptance
  + [IR3-IA04] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR3-IA03 acceptance
  + [IR3-IA05] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR3-IA04 acceptance
  + [IR3-IA06] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR3-IA05 acceptance
  + [IR3-IA07] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: route any authority semantics, trace identity, generated output policy, dependency, public API boundary, file inventory, or safety-boundary change to deeper reasoning

